od'),
+    (7, E'地點與問路', E'Places & Directions', 9, E'常見地點、方位詞、「在」與「有」、問路與指路、距離遠近', E'Common places, position words, 在 and 有, asking for and giving directions, near and far', E'郵局在銀行旁邊。 | Yóujú zài yínháng pángbiān. | The post office is next to the bank.\n廁所在哪裡？ | Cèsuǒ zài nǎlǐ? | Where is the restroom?\n一直走，到路口右轉。 | Yìzhí zǒu, dào lùkǒu yòu zhuǎn. | Go straight, then turn right at the intersection.', E'學校 | xuéxiào | school\n醫院 | yīyuàn | hospital\n銀行 | yínháng | bank\n郵局 | yóujú | post office\n車站 | chēzhàn | station\n公園 | gōngyuán | park\n廁所 | cèsuǒ | restroom\n餐廳 | cāntīng | restaurant\n圖書館 | túshūguǎn | library\n飯店 | fàndiàn | hotel\n機場 | jīchǎng | airport\n超市 | chāoshì | supermarket\n上 | shàng | up\n下 | xià | down\n前面 | qiánmiàn | front\n後面 | hòumiàn | back\n左邊 | zuǒbian | left side\n右邊 | yòubian | right side\n旁邊 | pángbiān | beside\n對面 | duìmiàn | opposite\n裡面 | lǐmiàn | inside\n外面 | wàimiàn | outside\n中間 | zhōngjiān | middle\n在 | zài | to be at\n有 | yǒu | there is\n走 | zǒu | to walk\n轉 | zhuǎn | to turn\n到 | dào | to arrive\n找 | zhǎo | to look for\n問 | wèn | to ask\n知道 | zhīdào | to know\n哪裡 | nǎlǐ | where\n怎麼走 | zěnme zǒu | how to get there\n多遠 | duō yuǎn | how far\n路 | lù | road\n街 | jiē | street\n紅綠燈 | hónglǜdēng | traffic light\n路口 | lùkǒu | intersection\n一直 | yìzhí | straight on\n遠 | yuǎn | far\n近 | jìn | near\n離 | lí | away from\n公尺 | gōngchǐ | meter\n分鐘 | fēnzhōng | minute', E'A：請問，郵局在哪裡？ | Qǐngwèn, yóujú zài nǎlǐ? | Excuse me, where is the post office?\nB：在前面，銀行的旁邊。 | Zài qiánmiàn, yínháng de pángbiān. | Ahead, next to the bank.\nA：離這裡遠嗎？ | Lí zhèlǐ yuǎn ma? | Is it far from here?\nB：不遠，走路五分鐘。 | Bù yuǎn, zǒulù wǔ fēnzhōng. | Not far. It is five minutes on foot.\nA：我要怎麼走？ | Wǒ yào zěnme zǒu? | How do I get there?\nB：一直走，到紅綠燈右轉。 | Yìzhí zǒu, dào hónglǜdēng yòu zhuǎn. | Go straight, then turn right at the traffic light.\nA：謝謝你！ | Xièxie nǐ! | Thank you!\nB：不客氣。 | Bú kèqi. | You are welcome.', E'交通與出行', E'Getting Around'),
+    (8, E'交通', E'Transportation', 9, E'交通工具、「坐／騎／開」、「從……到……」、搭車時間、買票與換車', E'Means of transport, 坐 / 騎 / 開, 從……到……, travel time, buying tickets and transferring', E'我坐公車去學校。 | Wǒ zuò gōngchē qù xuéxiào. | I take the bus to school.\n去機場怎麼走？ | Qù jīchǎng zěnme zǒu? | How do I get to the airport?\n要坐四十分鐘。 | Yào zuò sìshí fēnzhōng. | It takes forty minutes.', E'公車 | gōngchē | bus\n捷運 | jiéyùn | MRT\n火車 | huǒchē | train\n高鐵 | gāotiě | high-speed rail\n計程車 | jìchéngchē | taxi\n飛機 | fēijī | airplane\n腳踏車 | jiǎotàchē | bicycle\n機車 | jīchē | scooter\n船 | chuán | boat\n車站 | chēzhàn | station\n機場 | jīchǎng | airport\n站 | zhàn | stop\n出口 | chūkǒu | exit\n入口 | rùkǒu | entrance\n坐 | zuò | to ride (as a passenger)\n騎 | qí | to ride (a bike)\n開 | kāi | to drive\n走 | zǒu | to walk\n去 | qù | to go\n來 | lái | to come\n回 | huí | to return\n到 | dào | to arrive\n下車 | xià chē | to get off\n上車 | shàng chē | to get on\n換車 | huàn chē | to transfer\n票 | piào | ticket\n買票 | mǎi piào | to buy a ticket\n單程 | dānchéng | one way\n來回 | láihuí | round trip\n小時 | xiǎoshí | hour\n分鐘 | fēnzhōng | minute\n多久 | duōjiǔ | how long\n早 | zǎo | early\n晚 | wǎn | late\n快 | kuài | fast\n慢 | màn | slow\n從 | cóng | from\n司機 | sījī | driver', E'A：請問，去機場怎麼走？ | Qǐngwèn, qù jīchǎng zěnme zǒu? | Excuse me, how do I get to the airport?\nB：你可以坐捷運，在台北車站換車。 | Nǐ kěyǐ zuò jiéyùn, zài Táiběi chēzhàn huàn chē. | You can take the MRT and transfer at Taipei Main Station.\nA：要坐多久？ | Yào zuò duōjiǔ? | How long does it take?\nB：大概四十分鐘。 | Dàgài sìshí fēnzhōng. | About forty minutes.\nA：謝謝，我想買一張單程票。 | Xièxie, wǒ xiǎng mǎi yì zhāng dānchéng piào. | Thanks. I would like a one-way ticket.\nB：好的，一共八十元。 | Hǎo de, yígòng bāshí yuán. | OK, 80 dollars in total.', E'交通與出行', E'Getting Around'),
+    (9, E'日常作息', E'Daily Routine', 9, E'一天的作息、頻率副詞、「先……然後……」、時間詞位置、「以後」', E'A daily routine, frequency adverbs, 先……然後……, where time words go, 以後', E'我早上七點起床。 | Wǒ zǎoshang qī diǎn qǐchuáng. | I get up at seven in the morning.\n我每天喝咖啡。 | Wǒ měitiān hē kāfēi. | I drink coffee every day.\n下班以後我去運動。 | Xiàbān yǐhòu wǒ qù yùndòng. | After work I go to exercise.', E'早上 | zǎoshang | morning\n中午 | zhōngwǔ | noon\n下午 | xiàwǔ | afternoon\n晚上 | wǎnshang | evening\n每天 | měitiān | every day\n平常 | píngcháng | usually\n常常 | chángcháng | often\n有時候 | yǒu shíhou | sometimes\n從來不 | cónglái bù | never\n已經 | yǐjīng | already\n還沒 | hái méi | not yet\n起床 | qǐchuáng | to get up\n刷牙 | shuāyá | to brush teeth\n洗澡 | xǐzǎo | to take a shower\n吃早餐 | chī zǎocān | to eat breakfast\n上班 | shàngbān | to go to work\n下班 | xiàbān | to get off work\n上課 | shàngkè | to attend class\n下課 | xiàkè | to finish class\n回家 | huíjiā | to go home\n睡覺 | shuìjiào | to sleep\n休息 | xiūxi | to rest\n看書 | kànshū | to read\n看電視 | kàn diànshì | to watch TV\n運動 | yùndòng | to exercise\n做飯 | zuòfàn | to cook\n洗衣服 | xǐ yīfu | to do laundry\n玩 | wán | to play\n聽音樂 | tīng yīnyuè | to listen to music\n上網 | shàngwǎng | to go online\n然後 | ránhòu | then\n先 | xiān | first\n再 | zài | again or then\n一起 | yìqǐ | together\n每 | měi | every\n點 | diǎn | o''clock\n半 | bàn | half\n累 | lèi | tired\n忙 | máng | busy\n以後 | yǐhòu | after', E'A：你每天幾點起床？ | Nǐ měitiān jǐ diǎn qǐchuáng? | What time do you get up every day?\nB：我平常六點半起床，然後吃早餐。 | Wǒ píngcháng liù diǎn bàn qǐchuáng, ránhòu chī zǎocān. | Usually 6:30, then I eat breakfast.\nA：你幾點上班？ | Nǐ jǐ diǎn shàngbān? | What time do you start work?\nB：八點半。下班以後我常常去運動。 | Bā diǎn bàn. Xiàbān yǐhòu wǒ chángcháng qù yùndòng. | 8:30. After work I often exercise.\nA：你幾點睡覺？ | Nǐ jǐ diǎn shuìjiào? | What time do you go to bed?\nB：我十一點睡覺。 | Wǒ shíyī diǎn shuìjiào. | I go to bed at eleven.', E'日常生活', E'Daily Life'),
+    (10, E'天氣與衣著', E'Weather & Clothing', 9, E'天氣與四季、「很＋形容詞」、「會」表示預測、「有點」、依天氣選衣物與帶東西', E'Weather and seasons, 很 plus adjectives, 會 for predictions, 有點, choosing clothes and what to bring by the weather', E'今天很熱。 | Jīntiān hěn rè. | Today is very hot.\n明天會下雨。 | Míngtiān huì xià yǔ. | It will rain tomorrow.\n我要穿外套。 | Wǒ yào chuān wàitào. | I will wear a coat.', E'天氣 | tiānqì | weather\n晴天 | qíngtiān | sunny day\n陰天 | yīntiān | cloudy day\n下雨 | xià yǔ | to rain\n下雪 | xià xuě | to snow\n風 | fēng | wind\n太陽 | tàiyáng | sun\n雲 | yún | cloud\n溫度 | wēndù | temperature\n度 | dù | degree\n舒服 | shūfu | comfortable\n悶 | mèn | stuffy\n熱 | rè | hot\n冷 | lěng | cold\n涼快 | liángkuài | cool\n暖和 | nuǎnhuo | warm\n潮濕 | cháoshī | humid\n乾 | gān | dry\n春天 | chūntiān | spring\n夏天 | xiàtiān | summer\n秋天 | qiūtiān | autumn\n冬天 | dōngtiān | winter\n季節 | jìjié | season\n穿 | chuān | to wear\n外套 | wàitào | coat\n襯衫 | chènshān | shirt\n裙子 | qúnzi | skirt\n褲子 | kùzi | pants\n高跟鞋 | gāogēnxié | high heels\n輕 | qīng | light\n厚 | hòu | thick\n雨傘 | yǔsǎn | umbrella\n帶 | dài | to bring\n帽子 | màozi | hat\n眼鏡 | yǎnjìng | glasses\n太陽眼鏡 | tàiyáng yǎnjìng | sunglasses\n會 | huì | will\n可能 | kěnéng | maybe\n有點 | yǒudiǎn | a bit', E'A：明天天氣怎麼樣？ | Míngtiān tiānqì zěnmeyàng? | How will the weather be tomorrow?\nB：明天會下雨，而且很冷。 | Míngtiān huì xià yǔ, érqiě hěn lěng. | It will rain tomorrow, and it will be cold.\nA：那我要穿外套，還要帶雨傘。 | Nà wǒ yào chuān wàitào, hái yào dài yǔsǎn. | Then I will wear a coat and bring an umbrella.\nB：對，別忘了。 | Duì, bié wàng le. | Right, do not forget.\nA：我的帽子也要帶嗎？ | Wǒ de màozi yě yào dài ma? | Do I need to bring my hat too?\nB：不用，帶雨傘就可以了。 | Búyòng, dài yǔsǎn jiù kěyǐ le. | No need. An umbrella is enough.', E'日常生活', E'Daily Life'),
