+    (12, E'健康與生活服務', E'Health & Daily Services', 9, E'身體部位與症狀、掛號看病、「有點」與「了」、聽懂醫生建議、打電話預約、郵局與銀行', E'Body parts and symptoms, registering and seeing a doctor, 有點 and 了, understanding the doctor, booking by phone, the post office and bank', E'我頭痛。 | Wǒ tóutòng. | I have a headache.\n我有點發燒。 | Wǒ yǒudiǎn fāshāo. | I have a slight fever.\n我想預約明天下午。 | Wǒ xiǎng yùyuē míngtiān xiàwǔ. | I would like to book tomorrow afternoon.', E'頭 | tóu | head\n眼睛 | yǎnjing | eye\n耳朵 | ěrduo | ear\n鼻子 | bízi | nose\n嘴 | zuǐ | mouth\n手 | shǒu | hand\n腳 | jiǎo | foot\n肚子 | dùzi | stomach\n喉嚨 | hóulóng | throat\n身體 | shēntǐ | body\n不舒服 | bù shūfu | unwell\n痛 | tòng | pain\n頭痛 | tóutòng | headache\n發燒 | fāshāo | fever\n咳嗽 | késou | to cough\n感冒 | gǎnmào | cold (illness)\n拉肚子 | lā dùzi | to have diarrhea\n累 | lèi | tired\n醫生 | yīshēng | doctor\n醫院 | yīyuàn | hospital\n診所 | zhěnsuǒ | clinic\n掛號 | guàhào | to register\n藥 | yào | medicine\n吃藥 | chī yào | to take medicine\n休息 | xiūxi | to rest\n護士 | hùshi | nurse\n藥局 | yàojú | pharmacy\n電話 | diànhuà | telephone\n打電話 | dǎ diànhuà | to make a call\n手機 | shǒujī | mobile phone\n郵局 | yóujú | post office\n銀行 | yínháng | bank\n寄 | jì | to mail\n包裹 | bāoguǒ | parcel\n信 | xìn | letter\n有點 | yǒudiǎn | a bit\n了 | le | change or completion particle\n已經 | yǐjīng | already\n應該 | yīnggāi | should\n多 | duō | more\n喂 | wéi | hello (on the phone)\n預約 | yùyuē | to make an appointment', E'A：你哪裡不舒服？ | Nǐ nǎlǐ bù shūfu? | What is wrong?\nB：我頭痛，有點發燒，也咳嗽。 | Wǒ tóutòng, yǒudiǎn fāshāo, yě késou. | I have a headache, a slight fever and a cough.\nA：從什麼時候開始的？ | Cóng shénme shíhou kāishǐ de? | Since when?\nB：從昨天開始。 | Cóng zuótiān kāishǐ. | Since yesterday.\nA：你感冒了。多休息，一天吃三次藥。 | Nǐ gǎnmào le. Duō xiūxi, yì tiān chī sān cì yào. | You have a cold. Rest more and take the medicine three times a day.\nB：謝謝醫生。我想預約下次的時間。 | Xièxie yīshēng. Wǒ xiǎng yùyuē xiàcì de shíjiān. | Thank you, doctor. I would like to book the next visit.', E'健康與生活服務', E'Health & Services'),
